<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs sells Costa Crociere holding.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs sells Costa Crociere holding.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chargeurs said on Friday it had sold its stake in Costa Crociere, as had been planned, to Carnival Cruise Line and Airtours.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the sale &quot;brought in&quot; 150 million francs.</p>
</text>
